      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You invoke the Gifts of the Lady with utmost purity. You are amongst her most devout and pious of champions, channeling her will on the battlefield like a true paladin of</p><p>Bretonnia! You may select one of the two paths below, gaining one effect of the Virtue while losing the other:</p><ol><li><p><strong>Path of Saints:</strong> If you roll a successful Pray Test, you can choose to either use your rolled SL, or the number rolled on your units die.</p></li><li><p><strong>Path of War:</strong> Add the Invoke (The Lady) Talent to any career you enter.</p></li></ol>"
